    <td>Nicotine dependence, cigars, about ten a day for more than forty years</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>F17.290</td><td>S — Synthetic modern diagnosis linked to documented heavy cigar smoking.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-3">
    <td>Painful swallowing with oropharyngeal dysphagia from the tonsillar tumor</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>R13.12</td><td>S — Synthetic symptom diagnosis echoing the documented painful swallowing.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-4">
    <td>Unintended weight loss from painful swallowing, about 2 kg before presentation and 9% of body weight by the end of treatment</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>R63.4</td><td>S — Synthetic finding from the measured weights.</td>
  </tr></tbody></table></text>

